{"skill":{"slug":"gemini","displayName":"Gemini"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545316392,"changelog":"","changelogSource":null,"license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":746,"sha256":"bd1a39d637571c70c3c5e6deeec4d2ce9a8e612ad8df1ef178b4bc24f2eea8e5","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1782,"sha256":"bb773f39fe3eb837651fe6ae37349a0a67f9a4fa40222b20e5f15bdca43ee828","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789013559992,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f77d558538e692f818f8d4129426b6abda2cf297f5b59b586b5c176434e56056","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f77d558538e692f818f8d4129426b6abda2cf297f5b59b586b5c176434e56056","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: gemini\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. It defines an OpenClaw skill to interact with the Gemini CLI, providing installation instructions via `brew` and usage examples. All instructions in `SKILL.md` are directly related to the stated purpose of using the `gemini` command-line tool. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence, or prompt injection attempts against the agent. Notably, the `SKILL.md` even includes a safety instruction to 'Avoid `--yolo` for safety'.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159611516},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789013559992},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a small Gemini CLI helper whose disclosed behavior matches its stated purpose.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of an external Gemini provider is expected for this purpose, but prompts and any included context may be sent to that provider.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Install metadata requests the gemini binary through the Homebrew gemini-cli formula; no bundled executable scripts or hidden install steps were present in the inspected artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Runtime guidance is narrow and user-directed, including an explicit instruction to avoid interactive mode for prompts and to avoid the unsafe --yolo option.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill does not define background services, hooks, memory writes, or privilege escalation; it notes that the user may need to run an interactive Gemini login flow, which may create local CLI authentication state.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact only instructs use of the Gemini CLI for one-shot prompts, model selection, JSON output, and extension management, which is coherent with its Q&A, summary, and generation purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be comfortable with Homebrew installing the Gemini CLI and with prompt content being processed by Google's Gemini service. Avoid sending secrets or private data unless your Gemini account and data-handling settings are appropriate, and keep the artifact's advice to avoid --yolo.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789013559992}}}}}